   ]
  },
  "anchorCoordinates": "気象庁 AMeDAS 観測所一覧, via public/data/phenology.geojson",
  "transitionDays": 5,
  "transitionNote": "JMA announces both edges as 「○月○日頃」 because there is a 平均５日間程度 transition at each, so no single day can be named. Those five days are the renderer's onset and withdrawal ramps, and both sit inside the announced window, so nothing is drawn on a day JMA did not name.",
  "undetermined": {
   "iri": 2,
   "ake": 26,
   "note": "Seasons whose edge could not be pinned to a date. 梅雨明け is far more often indeterminate than 梅雨入り, and the count rises with latitude: none at all in 沖縄 or 奄美, eight in 東北北部. 1993 alone accounts for ten of them — every region except 沖縄 and 奄美."
  },
  "hokkaido": {
   "regions": 0,
   "stations": 16,
   "note": "北海道に梅雨はない。JMA defines no 梅雨 for Hokkaido — 梅雨前線は北海道付近では不明瞭となることが多い. Its 16 stations belong to no region here, and the build asserts 86 + 16 = 102 against phenology.geojson so the absence is checked rather than inferred."
  },
  "note": "梅雨 is announced for a whole 地方, so the unit here is the region and not the observation station: there is no Shizuoka reading, only 東海's. Per-year values are deliberately not shipped — the map animates one climatological year — but all-years and era means are, for reference."
 },
